{"version":1,"content":"<p>胡杏兒2015年跟李乘德結婚，婚後育有3名兒子大仔李奕霆（Brendan）、二仔李奕霖（Ryan）及細仔李奕宏（Liam），夫婦不時在社交平台分享溫馨照。</p><p>適逢大仔Brendan的9歲生日，一家五口齊穿阿仙奴波衫在家慶祝，家中牆壁貼上HAPPY BIRTHDAY BRENDAN氣球，蛋糕也是阿仙奴隊徽，還有獎盃作裝飾，十分搶眼。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T08:42:56.519111+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T07:17:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T05:17:40.081533+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T08:37:42.910750+00:00","content_hash":"375ff05afc2d6d6a3683b4f243d31a7ec3bf7ef2b980b849b46245036c1937f4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}